#: options_divi.php:441
msgid "Warning: This can cause JavaScript errors in some cases and should be used with care. When enabled, scripts registered by plugins and themes will be deferred to improve performance and jQuery will always be loaded in the body."
msgstr "警告：此操作可能引发 JavaScript 错误，请谨慎使用。启用后，插件和主题注册的脚本将被延迟以提升性能，且 jQuery 将始终在正文中加载。"

#: options_divi.php:437
msgid "Defer Additional Third Party Scripts"
msgstr "延迟加载其他第三方脚本"

#: options_divi.php:434
msgid "Some third party scripts may be incorrectly enqueued without declaring jQuery as dependency. If jQuery is deferred, these scripts could break. If you are experiencing console errors after enabling the \"Defer jQuery And jQuery Migrate\" option, you can enable this option, which will load an additional compatibility script that will attempt to solve the issue. You can turn this feature off if everything is working fine without it."
msgstr "部分第三方脚本可能未正确声明 jQuery 依赖项。若 jQuery 被延迟加载，这些脚本可能出错。启用\"延迟加载 jQuery 与 jQuery Migrate\"后若出现控制台错误，可启用此选项加载额外兼容脚本来尝试解决。若运行正常则无需开启。"

#: options_divi.php:430
msgid "Enqueue jQuery Compatibility Script"
msgstr "加入 jQuery 兼容脚本队列"

#: options_divi.php:427
msgid "When possible, jQuery and jQuery Migrate will be moved to the body to speed up load times. If a third party plugin registers jQuery as a dependency, it will be moved back to the head."
msgstr "在可能的情况下，jQuery 与 jQuery Migrate 将被移至正文以加速加载。若第三方插件将 jQuery 注册为依赖项，则会被移回页眉。"

#: options_divi.php:423
msgid "Defer jQuery And jQuery Migrate"
msgstr "延迟加载 jQuery 与 jQuery Migrate"

#: options_divi.php:420
msgid "Enabling this option will lower the size of Google Fonts and improve load times, however it will limit Google Fonts support in some very old browsers. You can turn this off to increase support for older browsers at a slight cost to performance."
msgstr "启用此选项将缩小 Google 字体体积并提升加载速度，但会限制部分老旧浏览器的字体支持功能。如需增强旧版浏览器兼容性可关闭此选项，但会轻微影响性能。"

#: options_divi.php:416
msgid "Limit Google Fonts Support For Legacy Browsers"
msgstr "限制旧版浏览器对 Google 字体的支持"

#: options_divi.php:413
msgid "Enable caching of Google Fonts and load them inline. This reduces render-blocking requests and improves page load times."
msgstr "启用 Google 字体缓存并内联加载。这能减少渲染阻塞请求，提升页面加载速度。"

#: options_divi.php:409
msgid "Improve Google Fonts Loading"
msgstr "优化 Google 字体加载"

#: options_divi.php:406
msgid "If a page is built with the Divi Builder, the Gutenberg block CSS file is moved from the header to the footer. Since the file is most likely not used, we can load it later. This removes a render blocking request and improving performance."
msgstr "若页面使用 Divi 构建器构建，Gutenberg 区块 CSS 文件将从页眉移至页脚。由于该文件大概率未被使用，可延迟加载。此举能消除渲染阻塞请求，提升性能。"

#: options_divi.php:402
msgid "Defer Gutenberg Block CSS"
msgstr "延迟 Gutenberg 区块 CSS"

#: options_divi.php:399
msgid "WordPress loads it's own WordPress emojis. Modern browsers support native emojis, making WordPress's emojis unnecessary in most cases. Removing WordPress emojis removes unneeded assets and improves performance."
msgstr "WordPress 会加载自带表情符号。现代浏览器支持原生表情符号，多数情况下无需 WordPress 表情。移除后可减少冗余资源，提升性能。"

#: options_divi.php:395
msgid "Disable WordPress Emojis"
msgstr "禁用 WordPress 表情符号"

#: options_divi.php:392
msgid "Only load external JavaScript libraries when they are needed by a specific Divi modules on the page. This removes unused JavaScript from the main scripts bundle and improves load times."
msgstr "仅当页面特定 Divi 模块需要时加载外部 JavaScript 库。这将从主脚本包中移除未使用的 JavaScript，提升加载速度。"

#: options_divi.php:388
msgid "Dynamic JavaScript Libraries"
msgstr "动态 JavaScript 库"

#: options_divi.php:385
msgid "When Critical CSS is enabled, Divi determines an \"above the fold threshold\" and defers all styles for elements below the fold. However, this threshold is just a estimate and can vary on different devices. Increasing threshold height will deffer fewer styles, resulting in slightly slower load times but less of a chance for Cumulative Layout Shifts to occur. If you are experiencing CLS issues you can increase the threshold height."
msgstr "启用关键 CSS 后，Divi 会设定\"首屏阈值\"并延迟首屏下方元素的所有样式。但该阈值仅为预估数值，不同设备可能有所差异。增加阈值高度将减少延迟样式数量，虽会略微降低加载速度，但能减少累积布局偏移发生几率。若遇到 CLS 问题，可提高阈值高度。"

#: options_divi.php:382
msgid "High"
msgstr "高"

#: options_divi.php:382
msgid "Low"
msgstr "低"

#: options_divi.php:380
msgid "Critical Threshold Height"
msgstr "关键阈值高度"

#: options_divi.php:377
msgid "Critical CSS greatly improves website load times and Google PageSpeed scores by deferring non-critical styles and eliminating render-blocking CSS requests."
msgstr "关键 CSS 通过延迟非关键样式并消除渲染阻塞的 CSS 请求，显著改善网站加载速度与 Google PageSpeed 评分。"

#: options_divi.php:370
msgid "This option dequeues the Divi style.css file and prints the contents in-line. This removes a render blocking request and improves the PageSpeed scores of individual pages. However, it also prevents the style.css file from being cached. Since the stylesheet is small, it's recommended to keep this option enabled."
msgstr "此选项将取消 Divi style.css 文件的队列排队，并将其内容内联打印。此举可消除渲染阻塞请求，提升单页 PageSpeed 评分。但会阻止 style.css 文件被缓存。鉴于样式表体积较小，建议保持启用此选项。"

#: options_divi.php:366
msgid "Load Dynamic Stylesheet In-line"
msgstr "内联加载动态样式表"

#: options_divi.php:363
msgid "The Divi icon font is broken up into various subsets. These subsets are loaded only when needed based on the modules and features used on each page. If you need access to the entire icon font on all pages (for example, if you are using our icon font in your child theme), then you can disable this option and load the entire icon font library on all pages."
msgstr "Divi 图标字体被拆分为多个子集。这些子集仅当页面使用相关模块和功能时才会加载。若需在所有页面使用完整图标字体（例如在子主题中使用图标字体），可禁用此选项以全站加载完整图标字体库。"

#: options_divi.php:359
msgid "Dynamic Icons"
msgstr "动态图标"

#: options_divi.php:356
msgid "Dynamic CSS greatly reduces CSS file size by dynamically generating only the assets necessary for the features and modules you use. This eliminates all file bloat and greatly improves load times."
msgstr "动态 CSS 通过动态生成仅需的功能与模块资源，大幅缩减 CSS 文件体积。这消除了所有文件冗余，显著提升加载速度。"

#: options_divi.php:349
msgid "Enable this to allow the Divi Framework to only load the modules that are used on the page, and process the logic for the features in use."
msgstr "启用此项后，Divi 框架将仅加载页面使用的模块，并处理在用功能的逻辑。"

#: options_divi.php:345
msgid "Dynamic Module Framework"
msgstr "动态模块框架"

#: options_divi.php:191
msgid "Show X Icon"
msgstr "显示 X 图标"

