#. translators: %1$s: "Save" or "Publish" - label.
#: includes/builder/functions.php:11426
msgid "When you are all done, you can save your changes by clicking the %1$s button inside of your page settings bar. You can also press Ctrl + S at any time to save your changes. Click the highlighted Save button to save your changes. Don’t worry, the page you were working on before starting this tour will not be lost!"
msgstr "完成编辑后，点击页面设置栏中的%1$s按钮即可保存更改。您也可以随时按Ctrl+S保存更改。点击高亮的保存按钮保存更改。请放心，开始本导览前正在编辑的页面不会丢失！"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11423
msgid "Save Your Page"
msgstr "保存页面"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11420
msgid "Here you can undo, redo or restore a saved history state. If you change your mind about recent changes, simply click back in time and start building again. You can also undo and redo recent changes. Click the undo and redo buttons and then accept your changes by clicking the green check mark."
msgstr "此处可撤销、重做或恢复已保存的历史状态。若对近期更改不满意，只需及时回退即可重新开始。您也可以撤销和重做近期更改。点击撤销和重做按钮后，通过绿色对勾确认更改。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11419
msgid "Undo, Redo And Restore"
msgstr "撤销、重做与恢复"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11416
msgid "Every change you make while editing your page is saved in your editing history. You can navigate backwards and forwards through time to any point during your current editing session, as well as undo and redo recent changes. Click the highlighted History button to access your editing history. "
msgstr "页面编辑过程中的所有更改都会保存在编辑历史中。您可以在当前编辑会话中前后导航至任意时间点，还能撤销和重做近期更改。点击高亮的历史按钮访问编辑历史。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11415
msgid "Access Your Editing History"
msgstr "访问编辑历史记录"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11412
msgid "You can switch back and forth between each preview mode freely while editing your page. Now that we have previewed our page on Tablet, let’s switch back to Desktop preview mode by clicking the highlighted button."
msgstr "编辑页面时可自由切换不同预览模式。完成平板预览后，现在点击高亮按钮切换回桌面预览模式。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11411
msgid "Switch Back To Desktop Mode"
msgstr "切换回桌面模式"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11408
msgid "While editing your page, it’s easy to see what your design will look like on mobile devices. You can also make adjustments to your module, row and section settings for each mobile breakpoint. Click the highlighted “Tablet” icon to enter Tablet preview mode. "
msgstr "编辑页面时，可轻松查看设计在移动设备上的显示效果。您还可以针对每个移动断点调整模块、行和分区设置。点击高亮的\"平板\"图标进入平板预览模式。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11407
msgid "Preview Your Page On Mobile"
msgstr "在移动设备上预览页面"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11404
msgid "While using the Divi Builder, you can access your page settings by toggling the page settings bar at the bottom of your screen. Click the highlighted button to reveal your page settings."
msgstr "使用 Divi 构建器时，可通过底部页面设置栏访问页面配置。点击高亮按钮展开页面设置选项。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11403
msgid "Open Your Page Settings"
msgstr "打开页面设置"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11400
msgid "Click the highlighted green check mark button to accept your changes. "
msgstr "点击高亮绿色对勾按钮确认更改。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11399
msgid "Accept Your Changes"
msgstr "确认更改"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11396
msgid "Just like Modules, Rows come with a lot of settings that are separated into the Content, Design and Advanced tabs. Click the highlighted button to add a new background color to your row."
msgstr "与模块类似，行设置分为内容、设计和高级三个标签页。点击高亮按钮为行添加新背景色。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11395
msgid "Adjust Your Row Setting"
msgstr "调整行设置"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11392
msgid "Every Row and Section has its own set of options that can be used to adjust the item’s appearance. You can adjust its width, padding, background and more. To access a row’s settings, hover over the row and click the highlighted options button."
msgstr "每行和区块均有独立选项集用于调整项目外观，包括宽度、边距、背景等。悬停于行上方并点击高亮选项按钮即可访问行设置。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11391
msgid "Access Your Row Options"
msgstr "访问行选项"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11388
msgid "Now that you have copied a module using the Right Click menu, you can Right Click in a new location to paste that module. Using the right click options shown, click the “Paste Module” button to paste the module you just copied into the empty column."
msgstr "通过右键菜单复制模块后，可在新位置右键点击粘贴。根据显示的右键选项，点击\"粘贴模块\"按钮将刚复制的模块粘贴至空列。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11387
msgid "Paste Your Copied Module"
msgstr "粘贴已复制模块"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11384
msgid "In addition to hover actions, additional options can be accessed by Right Clicking or Cmd + Clicking on any module, row or section. Using the right click menu shown, click the highlighted “Copy Module” button to copy the blurb module that you just moved."
msgstr "除悬停操作外，右键或Cmd+点击任意模块/行/区块可唤出附加选项。通过显示的右键菜单，点击高亮\"复制模块\"按钮复制刚移动的标注模块。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11383
msgid "Access Right Click Options"
msgstr "使用右键菜单"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11380
msgid "Every item on the page can be dragged and dropped to new locations. Using your mouse, click the highlighted move icon and hold down the mouse button. While holding down the mouse button, move your cursor over to the empty column and then release your mouse button to drop the module into the new column."
msgstr "页面所有项目均支持拖放定位。使用鼠标点击高亮移动图标并按住按钮，将光标移至空列后释放鼠标，即可将模块置入新列。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11379
msgid "Drag & Drop Content"
msgstr "拖放内容"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11376
msgid "Whenever you hover over a Section, Row or Module in the Divi Builder, action buttons will appear. These buttons can be used to move, modify, duplicate or delete your content. Click the highlighted “duplicate” icon to duplicate the blurb module that you just added to the page."
msgstr "在 Divi 构建器中悬停于区块、行或模块时，将显示移动、修改、复制、删除等操作按钮。点击高亮\"复制\"图标，复制刚添加到页面的标注模块。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11375
msgid "Hover To Access Action Buttons"
msgstr "悬停唤出操作按钮"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11372
msgid "Whenever you make changes in the Divi Builder, these changes can be Undone, Redone, Discarded or Accepted. Now that you have adjusted your module’s title, you can click the red discard button to cancel these changes, or your can click the green button to accept them."
msgstr "在 Divi 构建器中的所有修改均可撤销、重做、放弃或接受。完成模块标题调整后，可点击红色放弃按钮取消更改，或点击绿色按钮确认修改。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11371
msgid "Accept Or Discard Your Changes"
msgstr "接受或放弃更改"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11368
msgid "Each Module comes with various settings. These settings are separated into three tabs: Content, Design and Advanced. Inside the content tab you can modify the module content elements, such as text and images. If you need more control over the appearance of your module, head over to the Design tab. For more advanced modifications, such as custom CSS and HTML attributes, explore the Advanced tab. Try adjusting the Title of your blurb by clicking into the highlighted field."
msgstr "每个模块配备多组设置，分设内容、设计和高级三个标签页。内容页可修改文本图片等模块元素，设计页提供外观精细控制，高级页支持自定义CSS和HTML属性等进阶修改。尝试点击高亮字段调整标注标题。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11367
msgid "Adjust Your Module Settings"
msgstr "调整模块设置"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11364
msgid "Within each column you can add one or more Modules. A module is basic content element. The Divi Builder comes with over 40 different content elements to choose from, such as Images, Videos, Text, and Buttons. Click the highlighted Blurb button to add a new Blurb module to the first column in your row."
msgstr "每列可添加一个或多个模块。模块是基础内容元素，Divi 构建器提供40多种内容元素（如图片、视频、文本和按钮）供选择。点击高亮标注按钮为行首列添加新标注模块。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11363
msgid "Add A Module To The Column"
msgstr "向列添加模块"

#. translators: %1$s: "Rows" - label.
#: includes/builder/functions.php:11358
msgid "Every section contains one or more %1$s of columns. You can choose between various column layouts for each row you add to your page. Click the highlighted three-column layout to add a new row to your section."
msgstr "每个区块包含一列或多列%1$s。您可为每行选择不同列布局。点击高亮的三列布局为区块添加新行。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11355
msgid "Add A New Row Of Columns"
msgstr "添加新列行"

#. translators: %1$s: "Regular" - label text, %2$s: "Specialty" - label tex,
#. %3$s: "Fullwidth" - label tex.
#: includes/builder/functions.php:11348
msgid "The Divi Builder has three different section types. %1$s sections conform to the standard width of your page layout. %2$s Sections can be used to create advanced sidebar layouts. %3$s sections extend the full width of your page and can be used with fullwidth modules. Click the “Regular” section button to add a new section to your page."
msgstr "Divi 构建器提供三种区块类型：%1$s区块适配页面布局标准宽度，%2$s区块用于创建高级侧边栏布局，%3$s区块延伸至页面全宽并可搭配全宽模块使用。点击\"常规\"区块按钮为页面添加新区块。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11345
msgid "Choose A Section Type"
msgstr "选择区块类型"

#. translators: %1$s: "Sections" - label, %2$s: "Rows" - label.
#: includes/builder/functions.php:11339
msgid "Now that your pre-made layout has been loaded, we can start adding new content to the page. The Divi Builder organizes content using %1$s, %2$s and Modules. Sections are the largest organizational element. Click the highlighted button to add a new section to the page."
msgstr "预制布局加载完成后，即可开始为页面添加新内容。Divi 构建器通过%1$s、%2$s和模块来组织内容。区块是最大的组织结构单元。点击高亮按钮为页面添加新区块。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11336
msgid "Add A New Section"
msgstr "添加新区块"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11333
msgid "Now you can see more details about the layout pack as well as a list of the layouts it includes. Click “Use Layout” to apply the layout to your page."
msgstr "现在您可查看该布局包的详细信息及其包含的布局列表。点击\"使用布局\"将其应用到您的页面。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11332
msgid "Choose A Layout To Start With"
msgstr "选择初始布局"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11329
msgid "Here you can see a list of pre-made layout packs that ship with the Divi Builder. You can also access layouts that you have saved to your Divi Library. Choose the “Divi Builder Demo” layout pack to see the layouts it includes."
msgstr "此处展示 Divi 构建器内置的预制布局包列表，您也可访问已保存至 Divi 库的布局。选择 \"Divi 构建器演示\" 布局包查看其包含的布局。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11328
msgid "Choose A Layout Pack"
msgstr "选择布局包"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11325
msgid "Loading pre-made layouts is a great way to jump-start your new page. The Divi Builder comes with dozens of layouts to choose from, and you can find lots of great free layouts online too. You can save your favorite layouts to the Divi Library and load them on new pages or share them with the community. Click the highlighted button to open the layouts menu and select a pre-made layout."
msgstr "使用预制布局是快速创建新页面的绝佳方式。Divi 构建器内置数十种布局供您选择，您也可以在线上找到大量优质免费布局。您可以将喜爱的布局保存至 Divi 库，在新页面加载使用或与社区分享。点击高亮按钮打开布局菜单，选择预制布局。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11324
msgid "Load A New Layout"
msgstr "载入新布局"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11321
msgid "Take the Tour"
msgstr "开始导览"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11311 includes/builder/functions.php:11443
#: onboarding/i18n/dashboard.php:31
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#. translators: %10$s: Tour video overlay, %1$s: "Section" - label,  %2$s: Add
#. icon markup, %3$s: "Row" - label, %4$s: Add icon markup, %5$s: "Modules" -
#. label, %6$s: Add icon markup, %7$s: Settings gear icon markup, %9$s:
#. Documentation link markup.
#: includes/builder/functions.php:11302 includes/builder/functions.php:11434
msgid "%10$sBuilding beautiful pages is a breeze using the Visual Builder. To get started, add a new %1$s to your page by pressing the %2$s button. Next, add a %3$s of columns inside your section by pressing the %4$s button. Finally, start adding some content %5$s inside your columns by pressing the %6$s button. You can customize the design and content of any element on the page by pressing the %7$s button. If you ever need help, visit our %9$s page for a full list of tutorials."
msgstr "%10$s使用可视化编辑器可以轻松构建精美页面。首先按 %2$s 按钮向页面添加新%1$s，接着按 %4$s 按钮在分区内添加%3$s列，最后按 %6$s 按钮开始在列内添加%5$s内容。按 %7$s 按钮可自定义页面上任何元素的设计和内容。如需帮助，请访问%9$s页面查看完整教程列表。"

#: includes/builder/functions.php:11299
msgid "Welcome To The Divi Builder"
