msgid "Dynamic JavaScript"
msgstr "动态 JavaScript"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1553
msgid "This is a very important performance setting that should be turned on. The Dynamic Framework removes bloat from the back-end. This greatly reduces CPU and Memory usage and improves website speed. You can turn this setting on in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Theme Options</a>."
msgstr "这是一个非常重要的性能设置，应当启用。动态框架可消除后端冗余功能，显著降低 CPU 和内存占用，提升网站速度。您可以在<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">主题选项</a>中启用此设置。"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1544
msgid "Dynamic Framework"
msgstr "动态框架"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1540
msgid "This is a very important performance setting that should be turned on. Dynamic CSS greatly reduces your website's CSS size, speeds up page load times and improves Google PageSpeed scores. You can turn this setting on in the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">Theme Options</a>."
msgstr "这是一个非常重要的性能设置，应当启用。动态 CSS 能大幅减小网站 CSS 文件体积，加快页面加载速度并提升 Google PageSpeed 评分。您可以在<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">主题选项</a>中启用此设置。"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1531 options_divi.php:352
msgid "Dynamic CSS"
msgstr "动态 CSS"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1527
msgid "This setting determines whether or not errors should be printed as part of the page output. This is a feature to support your site's development and should never be used on production sites. You can edit this setting within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "此设置决定是否将错误信息作为页面输出的一部分打印。这是用于支持网站开发的功能，绝不应在生产站点使用。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来编辑此设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1518
msgid "PHP: display_errors"
msgstr "PHP：错误显示设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1514
msgid "This setting affects how many input variables may be accepted. If the limit is too low, it may prevent the Divi Builder from loading. You can adjust your max input variables within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "此设置影响可接受的输入变量数量。若限制过低，可能阻止 Divi 构建器加载。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整此设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1506
msgid "PHP: max_input_vars"
msgstr "PHP：最大输入变量数"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1502
msgid "This sets the maximum time in seconds a script is allowed to parse input data. If the limit is too low, the Divi Builder may time out before it is allowed to load. You can adjust your max input time within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "此设置决定脚本解析输入数据的最大时间（秒）。若限制过低，Divi 构建器可能在加载完成前超时。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整此设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1494
msgid "PHP: max_input_time"
msgstr "PHP：最大输入时间"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1490
msgid "Upload Max File Size determines that maximum file size that you are allowed to upload to your server. If the limit is too low, you may not be able to import large collections of layouts into the Divi Library. You can adjust your max file size within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "上传文件大小限制决定允许上传到服务器的最大文件尺寸。若限制过低，可能无法向 Divi 资源库导入大型布局集合。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整此设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1482
msgid "PHP: upload_max_filesize"
msgstr "PHP：上传文件大小限制"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1478
msgid "Max Execution Time affects how long a page is allowed to load before it times out. If the limit is too low, you may not be able to import large layouts and files into the builder. You can adjust your max execution time within your <a href=\"%1$s\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "最大执行时间影响页面超时前的允许加载时长。若限制过低，可能无法在构建器中导入大型布局和文件。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整此设置"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1470
msgid "PHP: max_execution_time"
msgstr "PHP：最大执行时间"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1466
msgid "Post Max Size limits how large a page or file can be on your website. If your page is larger than the limit set in PHP, it will fail to load. Post sizes can become quite large when using the Divi Builder, so it is important to increase this limit. It also affects file size upload/download, which can prevent large layouts from being imported into the builder. You can adjust your max post size within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance."
msgstr "POST 数据最大尺寸限制网站页面或文件的大小。若页面超过 PHP 设置的限制，将无法加载。使用 Divi 构建器时页面尺寸可能很大，因此提高此限制很重要。该设置也会影响文件上传/下载，可能导致无法导入大型布局。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整此限制"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1458
msgid "PHP: post_max_size"
msgstr "PHP：POST 数据最大尺寸"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1454
msgid "By default, memory limits set by your host or by WordPress may be too low. This will lead to applications crashing as PHP reaches the artificial limit. You can adjust your memory limit within your <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini file</a>, or by contacting your host for assistance. You may also need to define a memory limited in <a href=\"%2$s\" target=_blank\">wp-config.php</a>."
msgstr "默认情况下，主机或 WordPress 设置的内存限制可能过低，当 PHP 达到人为限制时会导致应用程序崩溃。您可以通过修改<a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">php.ini 文件</a>或联系主机服务商来调整内存限制。可能还需要在<a href=\"%2$s\" target=_blank\">wp-config.php</a>中定义内存限制"

#: core/components/SupportCenter.php:1446
msgid "PHP: memory_limit"
msgstr "PHP：内存限制"

